{"ticker":"NBIS","updated":"2026-11-27T23:10:37Z","profile":{"longName":null,"shortName":"Nebius Group N.V.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"Netherlands","website":"https://nebius.com","fullTimeEmployees":1543,"marketCap":26203047936,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-29.38761,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":11.965955,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":231.6,"targetHighPrice":380.0,"targetLowPrice":84.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":5.713,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.75998,"operatingMargins":-0.18667999,"profitMargins":0.05685,"totalRevenue":2189799936,"beta":1.539,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":299.86,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":73.52,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Nebius Group N.V., a technology company, engages in building full-stack infrastructure to service the global AI industry in the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It offers Nebius builds full-stack infrastructure for AI, including large-scale GPU clusters, cloud platforms, and tools and services for developers. The company also provides TripleTen, an edtech platform for re-skilling individuals for careers in technolgy; and Avride, which develops autonomous driving technology for self-driving cars and delivery robotics. It has a strategic alliance with NVIDIA Corporation to support the expansion of the company's AI cloud infrastructure. The company was formerly known as Yandex N.V. and changed its name to Nebius Group N.V. in August 2024. Nebius Group N.V. was founded in 1989 and is based in Schiphol, the Netherlands.","summary_zh":"Nebius Group N.V.是一家科技公司，致力於建立全端基礎設施，服務於美國、英國和國際上的全球人工智慧產業。它為Nebius提供了建構AI的全端基礎設施，包括大規模GPU叢集、雲端平台以及為開發者提供的工具和服務。該公司還提供 TripleTen，一個教育技術平台，用於為個人提供技術職業再培訓； Avride 為自動駕駛汽車和送貨機器人開發自動駕駛技術。它與 NVIDIA 公司結成戰略聯盟，支持該公司 AI 雲端基礎設施的擴展。該公司前身為 Yandex N.V.，於 2024 年 8 月更名為 Nebius Group N.V.。 Nebius Group N.V. 成立於 1989 年，總部位於荷蘭史基浦。","sector_